  inside the 66 dp safe zone (a 33 dp radius circle around the centre of the 108 x 108 grid), so
  any launcher mask (circle, squircle, rounded square) leaves it intact. The rounded cream panel is
  deliberately larger and runs past the safe zone; only the dark face pill and the cheeks must
  stay inside it (the tongue may be trimmed by tight masks). Keep it in step with the SVG.
-->
